</div><main>
    <div id="Contentplaceholder1_T54DC235E003_Col00" class="sf_colsIn container" data-sf-element="Container" data-placeholder-label="Main"><img class='image-widget ' src='https://www.fao.org/media/images/dadislibraries/banners-and-cards/domestic-animal-diversity-information-system-(dad-is)5aa104b63154419fa97995753588bdb8.jpg?sfvrsn=fef54591_0' title='Domestic Animal Diversity Information System (DAD-IS)' alt='Domestic Animal Diversity Information System (DAD-IS)'
                        
                         />







<div class="card bg-primary text-color-white-fao">
    <div class="card-body">
        
        <h5>DAD-IS is the <strong>Domestic Animal Diversity Information System maintained and developed by FAO</strong>. It provides you with access to searchable databases of breed-related information and photos and links to other online resources on livestock diversity. </h5><p>Furthermore, you can find the <strong>contact information of all National Coordinators for the Management of Animal Genetic Resources</strong>. It allows you to <strong>analyse the diversity of livestock breeds </strong>on national, regional and global levels including the status of breeds regarding their risk of extinction.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
    </div>
</div>








<div id="swiperAutoCards-1" class="swiper-container swiper-cards swiper-auto-cards-container">
    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
            <div class="swiper-slide h-auto">
                <!-- Card component -->
                    <div class="card card-h-100">
            <div class="card-image ratio ratio-3x2">
                <img src='https://www.fao.org/media/images/dadislibraries/banners-and-cards/dad-is-1.png?sfvrsn=b766592c_11' alt='' loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">
The roles and values of animal genetic resources remain diverse, particularly with regard to the livelihoods of poor people.            </h5>


        </div>
    </div>

            </div>
            <div class="swiper-slide h-auto">
                <!-- Card component -->
                    <div class="card card-h-100">
            <div class="card-image ratio ratio-3x2">
                <img src='https://www.fao.org/media/images/dadislibraries/banners-and-cards/dad-is-2.png?sfvrsn=b007ffaf_11' alt='' loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">
There are around 8800 livestock breeds of 38 different species in the world, providing a diversity of products and services            </h5>


        </div>
    </div>

            </div>
            <div class="swiper-slide h-auto">
                <!-- Card component -->
                    <div class="card card-h-100">
            <div class="card-image ratio ratio-3x2">
                <img src='https://www.fao.org/media/images/dadislibraries/banners-and-cards/dad-is-3.png?sfvrsn=1967e325_11' alt='' loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">
Many breeds have unique characteristics that can contribute to meeting challenges related to climate change            </h5>


        </div>
    </div>

            </div>
            <div class="swiper-slide h-auto">
                <!-- Card component -->
                    <div class="card card-h-100">
            <div class="card-image ratio ratio-3x2">
                <img src='https://www.fao.org/media/images/dadislibraries/banners-and-cards/dad-is-4.png?sfvrsn=83922453_11' alt='' loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">
The threats to animal genetic resources need to be better identified and their potential effects better assessed, so that action can be taken            </h5>


        </div>
    </div>

            </div>
            <div class="swiper-slide h-auto">
                <!-- Card component -->
                    <div class="card card-h-100">
            <div class="card-image ratio ratio-3x2">
                <img src='https://www.fao.org/media/images/dadislibraries/banners-and-cards/dad-is-5.png?sfvrsn=b57d3743_11' alt='' loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">
Establishing and sustaining effective livestock breeding programmes are still major challenges for many countries            </h5>


        </div>
    </div>

            </div>
            <div class="swiper-slide h-auto">
                <!-- Card component -->
                    <div class="card card-h-100">
            <div class="card-image ratio ratio-3x2">
                <img src='https://www.fao.org/media/images/dadislibraries/banners-and-cards/dad-is-6.png?sfvrsn=4d11ab0a_11' alt='' loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">
The world’s livestock diversity remains at risk            </h5>


        </div>
    </div>

            </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Add Arrows -->
    <div class="swiper-button swiper-button-next">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-round btn-icon">
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i>
        </button>
    </div>
    <div class="swiper-button swiper-button-prev">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-round btn-icon">
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-left"></i>
        </button>
    </div>
</div>

<script type="text/javascript">
